# --- Never commit the archive itself ---------------------------------------
# Provider data carries redistribution restrictions (ECA&D public station
# data is non-commercial research and education only). The archive lives
# outside the repo by default via STATION_ARCHIVE_ROOT; these patterns are a
# second line of defence in case anyone points it at a checkout.
